					"content": "Ah, so they left. That's good...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718300703
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Wang Ping'an"
				},
				{
					"id": 718300703,
					"content": "Is there anything else I can help you with?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718300704
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 718300704,
					"content": "Hahaha. Thank you for your kindness. But you've already helped me so much. It wouldn't be right.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718300705
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Wang Ping'an"
				},
				{
					"id": 718300705,
					"content": "But if you're willing, it would help if you could find us some <color=#00E1FFFF>Sandbearer Wood</color>. You can consider it your official contribution to the repair work!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718300706
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Wang Ping'an"
				},
				{
					"id": 718300706,
					"content": "It is a good deed, after all. A little personal participation might bring you some good fortune.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718300707,
						718300709
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Wang Ping'an"
				},
				{
					"id": 718300707,
					"content": "I'll go get it for you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718300708
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 718300708,
					"content": "Haha, alright. Just bring the <color=#00E1FFFF>Sandbearer Wood</color> you find straight back to me.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Wang Ping'an"
				},
				{
					"id": 718300709,
					"content": "Have other people made any donations to the repair works?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718300710
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 718300710,
					"content": "Hmm, to be honest, not many people have. This is a very deserted place, so most people don't know that there is a temple here.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718300711
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Wang Ping'an"
				},
				{
					"id": 718300711,
					"content": "I also suspect that few people now remember the Yaksha known as Pervases...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718300712
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Wang Ping'an"
				},
				{
					"id": 718300712,
					"content": "But enough about that for now. Just bring the <color=#00E1FFFF>Sandbearer Wood</color> you find straight back to me.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Wang Ping'an"
				}
			]
		},
